---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import pfp from '../assets/pfp.png';
---

<Layout title="About — Charlie Liao">
  <main class="px-6 lg:px-[160px] py-14">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-start lg:px-6">

      <!-- Image placeholder -->
        <Image src={pfp} alt="Charlie Liao" class="w-full md:w-[400px] shrink-0 aspect-[3/4] object-cover rounded-xl" />

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 p-4 text-white/80 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        <p>hi Im charlie, i love coffee, making videos, and i love coffee, and videos
</p>
        <p>making videos was a cool side hustle when im still in school, now im turning it into a full time job, working as a solo freelancer, i handle everything all by myself, from  planning and organizing the set, finishing the shots and produce the final content
</p>
<p>if you're interested in working with me, just go to my contact page</p>

          <p>or feel free to send me a line at charlieliao99@gmail.com</p>
i'm looking forward to work with you!!
<p> and apparently i don't look like a character from the simpsons
</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>